#: brikpanel.php
msgid "BrikPanel: WooCommerce Admin Dashboard Theme"
msgstr "BrikPanel: tema dashboard amministratore WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: brikpanel.php
msgid ""
"Beautiful and modern Shopify-style WooCommerce admin panel & dashboard, "
"fully free, forever."
msgstr ""
"Pannello di amministrazione e dashboard WooCommerce moderno in stile "
"Shopify, completamente gratuito, per sempre."

